11:05:34.731 [transcriber] seg[185] KEEP      start=818.36 end=820.76 nsp=0.5691  text='Ох…'
11:05:34.731 [transcriber] seg[186] KEEP      start=820.76 end=823.98 nsp=0.5691  text='Ой…'
11:05:34.731 [transcriber] seg[187] KEEP      start=823.98 end=828.62 nsp=0.5691  text='Кого же потрясаю, я тогда…'
11:05:34.731 [transcriber] seg[188] KEEP      start=828.62 end=830.74 nsp=0.5691  text='Удала…'
11:05:34.731 [transcriber] seg[189] KEEP      start=830.74 end=832.06 nsp=0.5691  text='Боже, что-то…'
11:05:34.731 [transcriber] seg[190] KEEP      start=832.06 end=833.56 nsp=0.5691  text='ovуха.'
11:05:34.731 [transcriber] seg[191] KEEP      start=833.56 end=834.94 nsp=0.5691  text='Ох...'
